# Copy to .env (never commit it). Read at build time by Vite.

# The relay (docs/backend.md#the-record, #live-relay). The live socket defaults to the production relay
# (lib/sync/live.ts) and the record to the same origin's /api (lib/sync/transport.ts). `npm run dev` uses test mode's
# generated rows unless VITE_RECORD_URL is set (docs/ops/testing.md "Test mode"). Both emptied → the app shows "Not set up yet".
# VITE_RECORD_URL=https://island-fund-relay-test.island-fund-relay.workers.dev/api
# VITE_LIVE_URL=wss://island-fund-relay-test.island-fund-relay.workers.dev/room

# The gym bot's Worker (gym/), read by ボット → ジム (lib/gym/status.ts): the production one unless set; empty
# hides the section. Another origin also needs vite.config.ts's CSP connect-src.
# VITE_GYM_URL=https://gym-bot.island-fund-relay.workers.dev
# The ITS booker's Worker (its/worker), read by ボット → 保養所 (lib/its/client.ts): the production one unless set; empty
# hides 保養所. Another origin also needs vite.config.ts's CSP connect-src.
# VITE_ITS_URL=https://its-bot.island-fund-relay.workers.dev

# Base path of the static site: '' (the root, Cloudflare Pages) unless set.
# BASE_PATH=/sub
